    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPERIENCE FLIPPING, TRICKING, PARKOUR, AND CLIFF DIVING LIKE NEVER BEFORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tricking 0</i> is a physics-based sports simulation that lets you perform insane flips, master tricking combos, parkour lines, and dive off cliffs in full control. Inspired by the world of extreme movement sports, the game blends tricking, parkour, gymnastics, tumbling, cliffjump and dods mechanics into one fun and challenging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love movement, acrobatics, extreme sports or if you wonder how it feels to do a backflip, this is your game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FLICK-IT INPUT SYSTEM - 170+ TRICKS &amp; MORE  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Flick-It input system</strong> allows you to perform over <strong>170 unique tricks</strong>, with more than <strong>300</strong> planned for the full release. Using the right joystick and triggers, you can intuitively tricks, all without memorizing complicated button combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/814242bce4b8a8b592f42d27d8f49741.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/814242bce4b8a8b592f42d27d8f49741.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/814242bce4b8a8b592f42d27d8f49741.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SEAMLESS TRICK TRANSITIONS \u2013 INFINITE COMBOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Tricking 0, every trick connects seamlessly with every other trick, allowing you to go from a finite amount of tricks to an infinite amount of combos. The more you play, the more you can experiment with transitions, creating <strong>smooth tricking combos </strong>or <strong>powerful tumbling passes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/d00439ad86690e88d05ee8dd5482c310.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/d00439ad86690e88d05ee8dd5482c310.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/d00439ad86690e88d05ee8dd5482c310.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/69b53fa879b00cfd9e628dc6d43eb957.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/69b53fa879b00cfd9e628dc6d43eb957.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/69b53fa879b00cfd9e628dc6d43eb957.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PARKOUR &amp; ENVIRONMENT INTERACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trick off flat ground or take it to the next level by integrating <strong>parkour-style vaults, and wall flips</strong> into your combos. The game's physics adapt your tricks to different heights and surfaces, giving each location a unique feel. Explore the environment, experiment with different spots, and push the limits of what\u2019s possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/35ce1a765c81b9f4437a5eb862db551e.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/35ce1a765c81b9f4437a5eb862db551e.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/35ce1a765c81b9f4437a5eb862db551e.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/458b0a34d461079a80885e7a9cacd9bf.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/458b0a34d461079a80885e7a9cacd9bf.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/458b0a34d461079a80885e7a9cacd9bf.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FREEFALL &amp; CLIFF JUMPING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For <strong>huge jumps and cliff dives</strong>, activate the <strong>active ragdoll system</strong>. Control your character in mid-air, using your joysticks to control your arms to balance or initiate and stop twisting. With some practice this system lets you master <strong>cliff jumping </strong>and even <strong>d\u00f8dsing</strong>. Offering complete freedom to express yourself in the air</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/3226f01080a4ef018ac27f91f624b1d0.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/3226f01080a4ef018ac27f91f624b1d0.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/ac17fb04fb9cc2da0b337225cff461ac.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/ac17fb04fb9cc2da0b337225cff461ac.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/ac17fb04fb9cc2da0b337225cff461ac.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">X-RAY BONE BREAKING EFFECTS \u2013 FAIL IN STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When things go wrong, Tricking 0's <strong>X-ray bone-breaking effects</strong> and <strong>ragdoll physics</strong> make every fail hilariously brutal. Flip big\u2014or crash hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/f4869e11e7230e921cc890c8dbdb6963.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/f4869e11e7230e921cc890c8dbdb6963.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/f4869e11e7230e921cc890c8dbdb6963.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REPLAY SYSTEM \u2013 CAPTURE EVERY TRICK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect your tricks &amp; lines, and <strong>watch your best moments</strong> <strong>from every angle</strong> in slow motion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/bf626ef0d29f520e4ab04fc6d509c345.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/bf626ef0d29f520e4ab04fc6d509c345.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/bf626ef0d29f520e4ab04fc6d509c345.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZATION \u2013 MAKE IT YOURS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character with <strong>body proportion sliders</strong> and a selection of clothing options. The current choices are just the beginning, future updates will bring a wide range of outfits, accessories, and gear from top tricking and parkour brands</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br>LOCAL MULTIPLAYER &amp; GAME OF TRICK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends in local multiplayer or face AI opponents in skill-based trick battles</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Game of Trick</strong> \u2013 Like H.O.R.S.E or S.K.A.T.E. One player sets a combo, and everyone else must replicate it. Fail, and you take a letter. The last one to spell &quot;TRICK&quot; wins</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game of Add on </strong>\u2013 Start with a single trick, then each player adds a new move to the combo. Mess up the full sequence, and you take a letter. The last one to spell &quot;TRICK&quot; wins</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br>GAMEPAD DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed to be played with a <strong>gamepad</strong>, <strong>Tricking 0</strong> offers the best experience when using a controller. The intuitive <strong>Flick-It system and the freefall mode</strong> are optimized for analog sticks and triggers, giving precise control over your flips, twists, and bails</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\ude80 FUTURE OF TRICKING 0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tricking 0</i> is evolving beyond just a sandbox for flipping. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>full version</strong> will include : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Career Mode &amp; Progression</strong> \u2013 Start as a beginner and rise to become a legendary athlete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Online Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Train, compete, and session with your friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>More Tricks and Maps</strong>: With <strong>170+ tricks</strong> already in the game, there\u2019s more to come! New maps, spots, and tricks are on the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Expanded Customization</strong>: Unlock more outfits and gear to make your character stand out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc65 <strong>JOIN THE COMMUNITY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Tricking 0 is still in development, and your feedback is essential!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This Alpha version is a work in progress, with frequent updates adding new tricks, maps, game modes, and features. I'm actively listening to the community and doing my best to respond to your feedback.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Join our <strong>Discord server</strong> to share your thoughts, report issues, and suggest ideas</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Let's make this game as great as it can be!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Follow <strong>@tricking.videogame</strong> on Instagram for regular development updates and news on the latest game additions</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPERIENCE FLIPPING, TRICKING, PARKOUR, AND CLIFF DIVING LIKE NEVER BEFORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tricking 0</i> is a physics-based sports simulation that lets you perform insane flips, master tricking combos, parkour lines, and dive off cliffs in full control. Inspired by the world of extreme movement sports, the game blends tricking, parkour, gymnastics, tumbling, cliffjump and dods mechanics into one fun and challenging experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love movement, acrobatics, extreme sports or if you wonder how it feels to do a backflip, this is your game !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FLICK-IT INPUT SYSTEM - 170+ TRICKS &amp; MORE  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Flick-It input system</strong> allows you to perform over <strong>170 unique tricks</strong>, with more than <strong>300</strong> planned for the full release. Using the right joystick and triggers, you can intuitively tricks, all without memorizing complicated button combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/814242bce4b8a8b592f42d27d8f49741.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/814242bce4b8a8b592f42d27d8f49741.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/814242bce4b8a8b592f42d27d8f49741.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SEAMLESS TRICK TRANSITIONS \u2013 INFINITE COMBOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Tricking 0, every trick connects seamlessly with every other trick, allowing you to go from a finite amount of tricks to an infinite amount of combos. The more you play, the more you can experiment with transitions, creating <strong>smooth tricking combos </strong>or <strong>powerful tumbling passes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/d00439ad86690e88d05ee8dd5482c310.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/d00439ad86690e88d05ee8dd5482c310.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/d00439ad86690e88d05ee8dd5482c310.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/69b53fa879b00cfd9e628dc6d43eb957.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/69b53fa879b00cfd9e628dc6d43eb957.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/69b53fa879b00cfd9e628dc6d43eb957.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PARKOUR &amp; ENVIRONMENT INTERACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trick off flat ground or take it to the next level by integrating <strong>parkour-style vaults, and wall flips</strong> into your combos. The game's physics adapt your tricks to different heights and surfaces, giving each location a unique feel. Explore the environment, experiment with different spots, and push the limits of what\u2019s possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/35ce1a765c81b9f4437a5eb862db551e.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/35ce1a765c81b9f4437a5eb862db551e.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/35ce1a765c81b9f4437a5eb862db551e.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/458b0a34d461079a80885e7a9cacd9bf.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/458b0a34d461079a80885e7a9cacd9bf.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/458b0a34d461079a80885e7a9cacd9bf.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FREEFALL &amp; CLIFF JUMPING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For <strong>huge jumps and cliff dives</strong>, activate the <strong>active ragdoll system</strong>. Control your character in mid-air, using your joysticks to control your arms to balance or initiate and stop twisting. With some practice this system lets you master <strong>cliff jumping </strong>and even <strong>d\u00f8dsing</strong>. Offering complete freedom to express yourself in the air</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/3226f01080a4ef018ac27f91f624b1d0.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/3226f01080a4ef018ac27f91f624b1d0.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/ac17fb04fb9cc2da0b337225cff461ac.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/ac17fb04fb9cc2da0b337225cff461ac.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/ac17fb04fb9cc2da0b337225cff461ac.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">X-RAY BONE BREAKING EFFECTS \u2013 FAIL IN STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When things go wrong, Tricking 0's <strong>X-ray bone-breaking effects</strong> and <strong>ragdoll physics</strong> make every fail hilariously brutal. Flip big\u2014or crash hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/f4869e11e7230e921cc890c8dbdb6963.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/f4869e11e7230e921cc890c8dbdb6963.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/f4869e11e7230e921cc890c8dbdb6963.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REPLAY SYSTEM \u2013 CAPTURE EVERY TRICK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect your tricks &amp; lines, and <strong>watch your best moments</strong> <strong>from every angle</strong> in slow motion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/bf626ef0d29f520e4ab04fc6d509c345.poster.avif?t=1752139957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/bf626ef0d29f520e4ab04fc6d509c345.webm?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1925560/extras/bf626ef0d29f520e4ab04fc6d509c345.mp4?t=1752139957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUSTOMIZATION \u2013 MAKE IT YOURS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your character with <strong>body proportion sliders</strong> and a selection of clothing options. The current choices are just the beginning, future updates will bring a wide range of outfits, accessories, and gear from top tricking and parkour brands</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br>LOCAL MULTIPLAYER &amp; GAME OF TRICK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your friends in local multiplayer or face AI opponents in skill-based trick battles</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Game of Trick</strong> \u2013 Like H.O.R.S.E or S.K.A.T.E. One player sets a combo, and everyone else must replicate it. Fail, and you take a letter. The last one to spell &quot;TRICK&quot; wins</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game of Add on </strong>\u2013 Start with a single trick, then each player adds a new move to the combo. Mess up the full sequence, and you take a letter. The last one to spell &quot;TRICK&quot; wins</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><br>GAMEPAD DESIGN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed to be played with a <strong>gamepad</strong>, <strong>Tricking 0</strong> offers the best experience when using a controller. The intuitive <strong>Flick-It system and the freefall mode</strong> are optimized for analog sticks and triggers, giving precise control over your flips, twists, and bails</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\ude80 FUTURE OF TRICKING 0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tricking 0</i> is evolving beyond just a sandbox for flipping. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>full version</strong> will include : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Career Mode &amp; Progression</strong> \u2013 Start as a beginner and rise to become a legendary athlete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Online Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Train, compete, and session with your friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>More Tricks and Maps</strong>: With <strong>170+ tricks</strong> already in the game, there\u2019s more to come! New maps, spots, and tricks are on the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Expanded Customization</strong>: Unlock more outfits and gear to make your character stand out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc65 <strong>JOIN THE COMMUNITY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Tricking 0 is still in development, and your feedback is essential!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This Alpha version is a work in progress, with frequent updates adding new tricks, maps, game modes, and features. I'm actively listening to the community and doing my best to respond to your feedback.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Join our <strong>Discord server</strong> to share your thoughts, report issues, and suggest ideas</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Let's make this game as great as it can be!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Follow <strong>@tricking.videogame</strong> on Instagram for regular development updates and news on the latest game additions</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Tricking 0 is a physics-based flipping game that lets you perform tricking combos, parkour lines, and cliff jumps with full control. With an intuitive Flick-It system, seamless transitions, and active ragdoll physics, it delivers the thrill of extreme movement sports, but without risking your neck",
